#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/fill_layers.rst:25
msgid ""
"By default, the dialog selects the flat color fill. This fills the layer "
"with a singular color. Since version 4.2, newly created colored fill layers "
"will be assigned to the currently active foreground color."
msgstr ""

